{"id":380,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"探究と協働で考え行動する力を育む","feature_description":"桐蔭学園中等教育学校は「自ら考え、判断し、行動できる子どもたち」を教育ビジョンに掲げます。授業ではアクティブラーニング型の学びや探究「未来への扉」を行い、問いを深め、他者と協働しながら課題に取り組みます。6年間を通じて自分や社会の将来を考え、未知の課題に挑戦する力を育てます。部活動は前期・後期の課程に応じた活動日数を定めています。","clubs":[{"id":7006,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://toin.ac.jp/ses/afterschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7007,"name":"軟式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://toin.ac.jp/ses/afterschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7008,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://toin.ac.jp/ses/afterschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7009,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://toin.ac.jp/ses/afterschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7010,"name":"ラグビー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://toin.ac.jp/ses/afterschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7011,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://toin.ac.jp/ses/afterschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7012,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://toin.ac.jp/ses/afterschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7013,"name":"ハンドボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://toin.ac.jp/ses/afterschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7014,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://toin.ac.jp/ses/afterschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7015,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://toin.ac.jp/ses/afterschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7016,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://toin.ac.jp/ses/afterschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7017,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://toin.ac.jp/ses/afterschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7018,"name":"武道部(剣道)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://toin.ac.jp/ses/afterschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7019,"name":"武道部(少林寺拳法)","c